+ * reference is zero by construction, so aliasing counts AGAINST an arm instead
+ * of for it. Null controls were bit-exact (0.0000, 0 px) on all three arms.
+ *
+ *     arm                      RMSE all   RMSE subj   vs no-AA   rendered
