+ * GHOSTING, AND WHY THERE IS NO VELOCITY BUFFER
+ * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * History is reprojected with the camera matrices only — the same depth
+ * reprojection `MotionBlurPass` already does, and for the same reason: a
