+          // frame and quietly turn the accumulation into a blur.
+          //
+          // Pixels at depth 1.0 -- the sky, and anything the scene never drew
+          // -- are deliberately NOT reprojected. Unprojecting the far plane is
+          // legal but its w is large and the result is dominated by depth
