+          // Off-screen history is not history. Falling back to the current
+          // sample gives an aliased edge for a few frames after a camera whip,
+          // which is correct: there is no information to reuse.
+          if ( any( lessThan( prevUv, vec2( 0.0 ) ) ) || any( greaterThan( prevUv, vec2( 1.0 ) ) ) ) {
